{
  "title": "[WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot - [Event] Share Your Game Review and Receive Gold Bars! - Steam News",
  "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/4891320/view/713412222387225882",
  "text": "STORE\nCOMMUNITY\nABOUT\nSUPPORT\nInstall Steam sign in  |  language\nAll Events > [WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot Events >\n[Event] Share Your Game Review and Receive Gold Bars!\nHello, Commanders!\nThis is War of Genesis: Idle Loot.\n\nThanks to your enthusiastic interest and support, we have prepared a Game Review Sharing Event!\nWe look forward to your active interest and participation!\n\n🎁 Event Details & Rewards\nPlay War of Genesis: Idle Loot and share your honest review with the community!\nLucky Commanders selected via drawing will receive in-game rewards:\n- 2 Gold Bars (1 Winner)\n- 1 Gold Bar (10 Winners)\n\n📅 Event Period & Winner Announcement\n- Event Period: From this notice ~ September 27, 2026 (Sun) 23:59 (UTC)\n- Winner Announcement: To be announced via notice after September 28, 2026 (Mon) (UTC)\n\n📝 How to Participate\n1. Play the game and write a game review in a community.\n※ Steam Community, personal social media accounts, and private channels are excluded.\n2. Click the link below and submit the URL of your post along with your account information to complete your entry!\n3. Feel free to submit all links where you shared your review! It will increase your chances of winning!\n[Participation Link] https://forms.gle/Pp3PK8BMQ8Dd74ch7\n\n⚠️ Important Notes\n- If the post from your submitted link has been deleted or set to private, it will be excluded from the drawing.\n- Please enter your account information accurately in the form to ensure reward distribution.\n\n🎮 Official Community [Discord]\nhttps://discord.gg/GyYsQ2xrPx\n\nWe will return shortly with even more exciting news.\nThank you!\nGAME\nFree To Play\nPOSTED \nTue, September 15, 2026\n@\n9:05 PM CST\nTYPE\nNEWS\n62\nRate Up\n19\nDiscuss\nShare\nABOUT THIS GAME:\nFree To Play",
